    "        \"I've sent 10 emails and nobody has replied. Is anyone actually working there?\",\n",
    "        \"The quality has gone completely downhill since your last update. Bring back the old version!\",\n",
    "        \"Your promises about features that 'are coming soon' are laughable. It's been 2 years!\",\n",
    "        \"I feel completely ignored and disrespected as a paying customer.\",\n",
